# Variables of the DEPLOY HOST (gmk1), read by ninabot-pro infra/aurane-deploy/deploy.sh from
# /root/.config/ninabot/aurane-deploy.env (0600). Never copied to the VM, never committed with values.
# Outside tester: Grok Automations « Aurane - notif déploiement ». Empty = no notification (deploy unaffected).
GROK_DEPLOY_WEBHOOK_URL=
# Optional signing secret (whsec_…) shown by Grok with the endpoint; signs the POST the Standard Webhooks way.
GROK_DEPLOY_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
